GET http://localhost:4000/admin-api/appointments


### GET DOCTOR APPOINTMENTS
GET http://localhost:4000/doctor-api/appointments/69b7c9ea55cbb8776dfc5de5


###

### UPDATE APPOINTMENT STATUS
PUT http://localhost:4000/doctor-api/appointment/69b8098bfc3d924613b7c145
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

###

### CREATE PRESCRIPTION
POST http://localhost:4000/doctor-api/prescription
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "69b8098bfc3d924613b7c145",
  "doctorId": "69b7c4fd91a13229cd66b4f5",
  "patientId": "69b7cd70adb026b610a21ec5",
  "diagnosis": "High BP",
  "medicines": [
    {
      "name": "Atenolol",
      "dosage": "1 tablet",
      "duration": "7 days"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Take after food"
}

