### BOOK APPOINTMENT
POST http://localhost:4000/patient-api/appointment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "69b7cd70adb026b610a21ec5",
  "doctorId": "69b7c4fd91a13229cd66b4f5",
  "specialization":"cardiology",
  "appointmentDate": "2026-04-02",
  "appointmentTime": "11:00 AM",
  "reason": "Chest pain"
}

