### UPLOAD MEDICAL REPORT
POST http://localhost:4000/patient-api/report
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "patientId": "PATIENT_ID",
  "doctorId": "DOCTOR_ID",
  "fileUrl": "https://cloudinary.com/report123",
  "fileType": "pdf"
}